{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19018","headline":"酬令狐相公亲仁郭家花下即事见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公亲仁郭家花下即事见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荀令园林好，山公游赏频。\n岂无花下侣，远望眼中人。\n斜日渐移影，落英纷委尘。\n一吟相思曲，惆怅江南春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}